# Laplacian specialized to an orthogonal / axis-aligned hex: the metric cross
# terms vanish, so the flux keeps only the normal component. The compiler then
# prunes BOTH tangential D-contractions and the interp buffer -- demonstrating
# the codegen leverage from one authored line (compare vs laplacian.op).
operator laplacian_orthocube {
    element = hex
    form    = diffusion
    flux    = g2*deriv
}
